    "detailed_description": "Re:Lords - Tales of Adventure is an anime strategic roguelike that combines auto-battler, deck-building and territory management. Set in a fantasy world, you, the player, are invoked as a protection deity by the queen to help her protect the land against a new threat. Lead your forces in an adventure spanning the whole continent, exploring mysterious and dangerous locations, and going to battle with your troops and your magic. There will always be four female companions by your side \u2013 as powerful as they are charming, helping you both in battle and with their wisdom. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593780/extras/26cedbdd633a2e16ed6ecb92845b48eb.avif?t=1735533507\" width=590 height=125 /></span><br><br>Build a deck that adapts to your playstyle and strategic approach, choosing between +300 unique cards. Every card has its own strengths, weaknesses and strategic value, so choose carefully to create the most powerful deck you can! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593780/extras/04ae8d5a3e66a6f9f1f6d4c9fc140a82.avif?t=1735533507\" width=590 height=125 /></span><br><br>Even though your troops will fight for themselves, it\u2019s your tactical skill as a general that will make the difference: choose when and how to deploy your soldiers to make the most of their forces, and cast powerful spells and skills to turn the tide of battle. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593780/extras/ba0c8464ef04f21922e91848285c15dc.avif?t=1735533507\" width=590 height=125 /></span><br><br>An army is as powerful as the logistics that sustain it! Build facilities that will allow you to gather resources and recruit soldiers for your armies to lay a solid foundation for your kingdom that will let you advance to new conquests. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593780/extras/2fc7b06d4bee5eabf6f71b81902c69ee.avif?t=1735533507\" width=590 height=125 /></span><br><br>An adventure that will last hundreds of hours: with a procedurally generated map, every playthrough will be unique; you decide where to explore next, how to develop your territories and when (and how) to engage in battle. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593780/extras/0e370ff191ff6f0159cc10968506b108.avif?t=1735533507\" width=232 height=76 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Four charming female characters as your companions.<br></li><li>Enjoyable Roguelike map exploration and territory management gameplay.<br></li><li>300+ unique cards and over 100 collectibles.<br></li><li>Turn-based strategic battles that combine auto-battler and card combat.</li></ul>",
